= wacss specification
<introduction>
wacss is a data-driven component library. Pass data, get a complete, accessible UI.

Wacss is designed to be give a complete specification of a design system by giving components a strict set properties they must follow and deriving the css from the allowed properties of each component. This gives assurance that a design system fully covers the target interface. This should help both users and AI Agents to be more predictable and efficient with their time.
